[{"title":"挽石适中 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"剸犀翻羽早称奇，亨会难遭但布衣。\n不使牙筹烦伯仲，果然玉树照庭闱。\n灵台久已天昭鉴，奏籍初闻子发挥。\n三世簪缨正无恙，如何遽作百年归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56811,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽石适中 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"南明山下读书堂，曾许寒生借烛光。\n高义岂殊亲骨肉，令人无复念家乡。\n那知十载天涯别，忽起三泉薤露伤。\n追恨故时携手处，不能执绋助棺傍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56812,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和朱仲明见赠闻琴","author":"邹浩","text":"子期骨发已埃尘，谁谓知音不复生。\n触处折杨争属和，独君忘味叹遗声。\n荜门寒日正多暇，玉麈高谈相与清。\n鹤举鱼沉重惆怅，一樽麦酒荐藜羹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56813,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赵希元忆处州梅花","author":"邹浩","text":"万花头上占天工，得意开时斗未东。\n破月麝脐来馥郁，横烟玉树净玲珑。\n暖归故蕊应欺雪，人在他乡正御风。\n借问殷勤动诗兴，忘机争似鹿皮翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56814,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬至夜梦中作","author":"邹浩","text":"炉烟飒飒对团蒲，暮去朝来只自如。\n还见人间好时节，群阴消尽一阳初。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56815,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中简次萧求团茶","author":"邹浩","text":"竹上松间敲玉花，最宜石鼎荐灵芽。\n蓬门不识苍龙璧，借问风流宰相家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56816,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和晦之见赠听琴","author":"邹浩","text":"忌子当年妙五音，曾令按剑革初心。\n昭文重愧难成曲，潘岳胡为缪见寻。\n在昔丝桐尝弃置，到今山水自高深。\n何当共造无弦处，莫使渊明擅此琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56817,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和晦之","author":"邹浩","text":"举世欣欣濮上音，丝桐还寄长卿心。\n知君韶濩思千载，劲节松筠挺几寻。\n万籁息时霜剑立，一灯明处夜堂深。\n他年振铎收遗器，岂愧云和瑟与琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56818,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"倒用前韵","author":"邹浩","text":"我有一张琴，穷高更极深。\n瓠巴那解鼓，师旷杳难寻。\n寂寂三冬夜，悠悠万古心。\n衣冠遍天宇，谁为作知音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56819,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵道卿寄同僚","author":"邹浩","text":"从事休嗟我独劳，何如对雪咏瀌瀌。\n圣贤潋滟冬来美，朋旧绸缪老不凋。\n仇览初年犹主簿，田单他日竟屠聊。\n上方侧席搜遗逸，未易沅湘作大招。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56820,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"督巨源和诗","author":"邹浩","text":"诗成七步有家风，底事淹留岁已穷。\n应笑枚皋太容易，欲令句似长卿工。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56821,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊行呈彦祖","author":"邹浩","text":"迟日初乾雪径沙，等閒联骑过田家。\n长官标格风尘外，衰草坡前报晚衙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56822,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和彦祖寄次萧","author":"邹浩","text":"格外参军事事嘉，竹窗全是子猷家。\n清狂上客知何处，恨不同燃柏径槎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56823,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柬理堂","author":"邹浩","text":"主人生长绮纨中，标致分明儒者同。\n结构不因穷鼎俎，栖迟聊欲事磨砻。\n血漫霜剑悲王凤，坐拥云鬟笑马融。\n铭府功勋久牢落，会须腾踏振家风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56824,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏社正李子温","author":"邹浩","text":"红莲上客有新篇，不见长安驿使传。\n寄语持纲社中老，可怜三百青铜钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56825,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄阳先生","author":"邹浩","text":"长揖公卿不转头，五车图籍指虔州。\n屑榆肯使家风坠，谢币空令世俗羞。\n弄凤骑龙诚莫及，坏车杀马恨无由。\n嵩山出处君知否，似与高人作覆辀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56826,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发山口堤上","author":"邹浩","text":"烟笼官柳柳笼堤，风引澄波细细移。\n骏马不知鞍上意，回头已是获麟陂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56827,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渡汶河","author":"邹浩","text":"旧来纸上得河名，今日横过彻底清。\n浚治早经神禹手，若为汩汩尚西行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56828,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过中都王彦章庙","author":"邹浩","text":"一时多难见忠臣，力拥貔貅捍此城。\n岂为圣人曾作宰，由来壮志在留名。\n铁鎗埋没今何处，庙食追崇事若生。\n功业已经华衮赠，只应长伴斗魁明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56829,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慎夺堂","author":"邹浩","text":"百鍊终成绕指柔，何人劲节拟横秋。\n目前轩冕自来去，堂上诗书尝讲求。\n风度绮疏香漠漠，月移苔砌竹幽幽。\n将军此意生平事，不似空言不到头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56830,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒轩","author":"邹浩","text":"结构俯危城，公馀杖履轻。\n事随尘自远，心与水长清。\n隐几鱼方乐，开窗雨乍晴。\n憧憧渡头客，谁会此时情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56831,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王宪湖上分韵得荷字","author":"邹浩","text":"使星明处是天河，习习轻飙生芰荷。\n自有芝兰随后乘，更容簪履侍鸣珂。\n未甘城鼓促清赏，聊与汀鸥分素波。\n异日定应如此少，云雷行欲起龙梭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56832,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王宪赴阙","author":"邹浩","text":"凤诏传天北，輶轩指建章。\n既能思贾谊，何患老冯唐。\n况是高门庆，从来美誉彰。\n灵台悬宝镜，峻节凛秋霜。\n庖刃诚难敌，黄陂岂易量。\n承家但清白，报国颇施张。\n属部分氂犬，终朝事锦囊。\n收功殊俗士，知已恃明王。\n此去堪前贺，胡为独倍伤。\n昔沾淮水润，今借德星光。\n折柳故多恨，衔环空不忘。\n他年重望履，应已步岩廊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56833,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王裘仲侍亲赴阙","author":"邹浩","text":"置榻初相得，膏车忽起行。\n秋风无限事，麦酒不胜情。\n原宪何曾病，丘明竟有声。\n从容湖上语，他日看功成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56834,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"试日怀世美","author":"邹浩","text":"挟策刚为泮水行，暖风迟日试诸生。\n姚黄魏紫知何许，独有杨花扑砚轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56835,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏王宽之 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"晚来闻说醉黄封，弦管欣欣急雨中。\n应笑西邻少风味，一炉沉水对梧桐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56836,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏王宽之 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"墨龙翻海几朝昏，今日晴阴似欲分。\n不道谷飞多作蛊，犹教歌扇遏行云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56837,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵世美简别乘喜雨","author":"邹浩","text":"一勺龙泉甫到城，滂沱疑是泻南溟。\n枣心正为斯民赤，菜色宁忧异日青。\n击壤田家方自得，掷金诗轴已交形。\n病来无复高阳兴，宴喜空烦置醁醽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56838,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上杂咏 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"何处清风作晚凉，解衣相与面沧浪。\n青萍紫芡令人恨，遮却琉璃万顷光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56839,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上杂咏 其三","author":"邹浩","text":"华亭标格本青云，邂逅西湖秋复春。\n作意一声君会否，鹓鸾集处是真人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56840,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上杂咏 其四","author":"邹浩","text":"疾病经旬厌药杯，喜君折简傍湖来。\n浓云几败乃翁事，赖有南风为约开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56841,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上杂咏 其五","author":"邹浩","text":"滨湖一一敞雕栏，自是黄尘不汝閒。\n今日舒眉宁易得，未应轻作剡溪还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56842,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上杂咏 其六","author":"邹浩","text":"霜蹄桧楫久途穷，暂喜天时人事同。\n濯热不须三岛去，高谈落麈自生风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56843,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上杂咏 其七","author":"邹浩","text":"嵯峨秀色雨晴时，极目城隅更落晖。\n何必鲈鱼动秋意，好携双屐便言归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56844,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登楼","author":"邹浩","text":"荜门真蚁穴，旷快一登楼。\n天地投双睫，诗书落九州。\n栏杆元诘曲，日脚更迟留。\n借问同来客，能同此意不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56845,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听泉","author":"邹浩","text":"天中悬日月，激激正鸣泉。\n洗耳岂吾事，披襟聊石边。\n焦桐无杂弄，佩玉有群仙。\n欲识偃溪语，于今蹄与筌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56846,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈同社","author":"邹浩","text":"太史占星久寂寥，高阳烟月但蓬蒿。\n人才岂是非前日，天意端如待我曹。\n万古衣冠归指顾，一时天地入风骚。\n他年南北参商去，知有青编破郁陶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56847,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马上 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"策马戴残星，郊原破暑清。\n人间千万事，并入一时情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56848,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马上 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"晴空云物不留形，大块遥呈一点青。\n闻说嵁岩隐君子，何当北面问黄庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56849,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马上 其三","author":"邹浩","text":"孤冢如山官路傍，老农指似是前王。\n可怜烜赫当年计，牧笛樵歌付夕阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56850,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"追凉","author":"邹浩","text":"三伏流金石，端居若探汤。\n古松摇落照，芒履促追凉。\n天壤知谁似，形骸亦自忘。\n何须北窗下，始解到羲皇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56851,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵参寥访和靖先生故居","author":"邹浩","text":"湖边高节与谁邻，落落寒松往往皴。\n就使衡门已尘土，不妨千古自阳春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56852,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"关氏四照亭","author":"邹浩","text":"孤亭缥缈枕烟霞，面面江山不用赊。\n何日乘风指星纪，与君携手逐飞鸦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56853,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿星院观竹","author":"邹浩","text":"祗园寂寞耸高材，自有鸾凰接翅来。\n回首壶觞散桃李，日斜风动使人哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56854,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王幼安赴举","author":"邹浩","text":"几年幽径委榛芜，此去寒生孰子如。\n笔下奔腾三峡水，胸中突兀五车书。\n岂惟丽赋欺弘正，会使清时识仲舒。\n富贵由来皆骨相，门闾高处莫趑趄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56855,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送二弟赴开封举","author":"邹浩","text":"古人捧檄缘亲喜，况值秋风一鹗天。\n相与抟空谢蓬艾，归来称寿綵衣鲜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56856,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"椹涧马铺壁间有黄元明诗因次其韵","author":"邹浩","text":"武当在何许，漠漠西南天。\n雷电正多事，道途如去年。\n参差挥麈约，妨废把书眠。\n破我征鞍恨，清诗犹灿然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56857,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纯孝墓","author":"邹浩","text":"禽犊何知尚母怀，黄泉相见岂宜哉。\n向非雅意一杯去，安得迷心中路回。\n自古功名随日月，于今庙貌倚崔嵬。\n可怜肉食趋朝者，粪壤纷纷久已灰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56858,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙翁山下遇王由正用驿壁二诗之韵见意 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"物外风期迹已陈，须知日月去来频。\n我今欲换神仙骨，还向山前逢异人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56859,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙翁山下遇王由正用驿壁二诗之韵见意 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"烟雨冥冥不肯晴，无因飞步数峰青。\n朅来山下倾谈麈，全似江边语醉醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56860,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阻雨呈由正 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"秋风吹雨入疏棂，永夜漫漫双眼明。\n借问泥涂困行李，何如南亩念西成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56861,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阻雨呈由正 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"炼石曾闻补就天，如何淫雨尚绵绵。\n只应知我班荆意，欲使从容夫子前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56862,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过仙翁山","author":"邹浩","text":"群山环拱一山青，曾驻仙翁竟得名。\n前日授书非我事，旄头不耀正休兵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56863,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"穰东驿壁间有诗因次其韵","author":"邹浩","text":"箠辔驱驰长眼花，更堪风雨作泥沙。\n邮亭准拟一醉倒，白酒黄鸡无处赊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56864,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"林堠驿壁间有诗因用其韵","author":"邹浩","text":"日转山亭寂寂，梦迷蝴蝶双双。\n何独渊明寄傲，吾今亦是南窗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56865,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早行","author":"邹浩","text":"朝来由气锐，前程入马蹄。\n天形随月见，斗柄傍人低。\n路转才萦白，沙平岂辨泥。\n露零欺鬓发，犬吠隔蒿藜。\n恍惚南柯梦，参差逢氏迷。\n比经十里堠，始报一声鸡。\n似脱关中日，如趋圯下蹊。\n脩真空有术，习懒信无梯。\n行李几时北，武当犹在西。\n谁知贵公子，角枕正清闺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56866,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"顺阳东山下小池","author":"邹浩","text":"行尽江山知几重，山前池沼尚残红。\n尘埃满眼欣相见，驻马垂杨夹岸风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56867,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将到均州","author":"邹浩","text":"武当孤垒插天西，一见都忘渴与饥。\n倦客惟贪早休歇，不知匏系未成归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56868,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵宇文伯脩题清溪驿梅花","author":"邹浩","text":"骥尾曾容蹑后尘，柳花榆荚古河滨。\n天衢事业已腾世，山驿诗篇知几春。\n梅萼故应如异日，风骚仍得慰幽人。\n须知犹是枯株在，早晚吹嘘近紫宸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56869,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入试院呈同事章显父推官及监试柴承之朝奉","author":"邹浩","text":"汉江汹汹不知休，江上谯门鼓角秋。\n匹马崎岖随国事，同心邂逅得儒流。\n何妨蟋蟀床头急，况是芭蕉雨脚收。\n别乘端容共萧散，从今相与傲浮丘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56870,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午枕觉怀世美","author":"邹浩","text":"睡乡天地肃秋风，日日欣随宰我踪。\n靖节有人须命驾，道途何事不相逢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56871,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李元礼墓","author":"邹浩","text":"几年模楷揭天中，四海衣冠尽影从。\n必待名人裁受谒，遂令当世比登龙。\n求通谩负孔融志，执御难追荀爽踪。\n回首高门正如市，悲风猎猎起长松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56872,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛汉江 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"汉江衮衮接天流，百里舟行一转眸。\n白浪激风鸣战鼓，青山迎棹走长虬。\n均阳已断南柯梦，酂上还惊宋玉秋。\n南望祖茔能几驿，王程不得下荆州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56873,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛汉江 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"谁家游女戏江滨，才见舟来竞敛身。\n须信文王风化远，至今犹自被行人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56874,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛汉江 其三","author":"邹浩","text":"山束长江激箭奔，扁舟冲破白鸥群。\n故人正在笙篁里，一枕滩声谁与分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56875,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀襄阳","author":"邹浩","text":"寄迹襄阳北，无因吊古人。\n卧龙应索寞，堕泪想鳞皴。\n不作庞公客，空回徐庶身。\n风流终自若，他日引车轮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56876,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵显父睡起偶成","author":"邹浩","text":"杜门无复辙声来，一日刚肠欲九回。\n消遣但能眠白昼，较量犹胜走黄埃。\n霜风却暑通归路，篱菊要人荐寿杯。\n同我此心君最切，更将幽思托清才。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56877,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别显父且约相见于南阳","author":"邹浩","text":"风帆催我上轻舟，不得追陪自在游。\n山路马蹄新雨霁，早来携手百花洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56878,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵监试喜引试有日","author":"邹浩","text":"朅来凡韵续高张，凫鹤居然分短长。\n鸣鼓未窥才气勇，悬河先饫古今详。\n三秋欲半月方好，万事兼忘心更凉。\n只愿真贤起山国，异时端委赞垂裳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56879,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上联句","author":"邹浩","text":"遥岑舣舟见，野思过桥生。\n兴尽回兰棹，归鞍月正明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56880,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"等閒来棹钓鱼船，鸥鹭相忘亦自然。\n多事脩鳞跃波底，一齐鸣翼上青天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56881,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"烟含夜色迷修竹，雁带秋声落晚沙。\n不是胸中有云梦，只应悽恻满天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56882,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]